&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The
submitted drawings are inconsistent.&amp;nbsp;
Therefore, insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate
whether the roof alterations would result in cubic content of the
resulting roof space exceeding the cubic content of the original roof space by
more than 50 cubic metres. As such, the local planning authority is unable to
establish whether the development would comply with limitation B.1(d)(ii) to Class
B of Part 1 (of Schedule 2) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted
Development) (England) Order 2015, as amended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;
