&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The existing side dormers project forward of a principal elevation.&amp;nbsp; As such, the development fails to comply with limitation B.1(c) to Class B of
Part 1 (of Schedule 2) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted
